  },
  {
    "file": "screen011.png",
    "sha256": "4272d013a74aaf593dc672263303cdd4eb99d497e59a03e2ed8775693b855fd8",
    "k": 10,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Hey, Kathy.",
    "zh": "嘿，凯西。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "hey"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen012.png",
    "sha256": "2187cb0b1501e1488ac31385600743efd409996270167ae960fe4e5f8b4f254f",
    "k": 11,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Did you read this article in the magazine?",
    "zh": "你看过杂志上的这篇文章了吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "article"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen013.png",
    "sha256": "7ddbe0105b298b0de7b941b181d402f4f2a0904fbc229115d28f6f560d93461c",
    "k": 12,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I can’t believe how much man’s changing the planet.",
    "zh": "我简直不敢相信，人类对地球的改变竟然这么大。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "planet"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen014.png",
    "sha256": "6a6a100bbb3e83f656b85f12cf64290f3b300b33e0975b97770d6ca0a21d7a32",
    "k": 13,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Yeah, I had a look at it.",
    "zh": "嗯，我看过了。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "have a look"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen015.png",
    "sha256": "7072079de72ca9e54f80dfce9b80bd1f7a83714bba03a81f65e79db0576cd4e6",
    "k": 14,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Quite interesting I suppose if you believe that sort of thing.",
    "zh": "我想，如果你相信这类事情的话，那倒挺有意思。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "suppose"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen016.png",
    "sha256": "37d09db0d0ebcdb35f0eebdcfb5178079fb8770a4dce879473e0da9b698a182f",
    "k": 15,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "What?",
    "zh": "什么？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "what"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen017.png",
    "sha256": "c871f0391b647af6008c3eab17e5bb54bed46f142bd4769dbbb2ce2e9d23eb8d",
    "k": 16,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "What do you mean “if you believe that sort of thing?”",
    "zh": "你说“如果你相信这类事情”，是什么意思？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "mean"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen018.png",
    "sha256": "6e6084ec9d76d5795645c60afcddd4456ee09bd473a54b23c0b8d20003d90b2a",
    "k": 17,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Are you saying you don’t believe that we are damaging the planet?",
    "zh": "你是说，你不相信我们正在破坏地球吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "damage"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen019.png",
    "sha256": "93b54efded77a5a6019708cb8d874b07debd8bf849af0fe2dac7bf973af33d36",
    "k": 18,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "To be honest, Mark, not really.",
    "zh": "说实话，马克，我不太相信。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "to be honest"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen020.png",
    "sha256": "e444a1fbe7af76aba542d24069af05d8948e07a5b67ed4607105d2007d20a5dc",
    "k": 19,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "What are you saying?",
    "zh": "你在说什么？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "say"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen021.png",
    "sha256": "ad351dd171a390e4f1c7427cf2624716e6373e4522ed7a7e3706f5c9b42a00b8",
    "k": 20,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Are you saying global warming isn’t a fact?",
    "zh": "你是说，全球变暖不是事实？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "global warming"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen022.png",
    "sha256": "33cf7dfa7e437668af8900ef60dc8d32ad7ff663337e92f723bda56370c9a2c8",
    "k": 21,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Deforestation isn’t a fact?",
    "zh": "森林砍伐也不是事实？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "deforestation"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen023.png",
    "sha256": "b702a52333b2771af1935cf85fc0026f9b7c6ced76c237b47694e4db808abd31",
    "k": 22,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "The greenhouse effect isn’t actually happening?",
    "zh": "温室效应也并没有真的发生？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "greenhouse effect"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen024.png",
    "sha256": "3feca02ccd8433ac0528834cd87d0fb56b395326b396821ad81c6a0815ccd5e8",
    "k": 23,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Hey, calm down Mark.",
    "zh": "嘿，马克，冷静一点。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "calm down"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen025.png",
    "sha256": "1b2fe5ea277aa04602464a7ae16c42b2491778f20714f19880e7cb60fe4011b7",
    "k": 24,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I just think too many people take these things as being definitely true without knowing all the facts.",
    "zh": "我只是觉得，有太多人还没了解全部事实，就认定这些事绝对是真的。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "definitely"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen026.png",
    "sha256": "c063835a1a41cbc7ff1222fee8f99d506d8026067ab40811f4706b14d9f8161a",
    "k": 25,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "You really don’t think global warming is happening.",
    "zh": "你真的认为全球变暖并没有发生？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "global warming"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen027.png",
    "sha256": "2f323649986e3895a972805b5f20a71224dcd928028eefd77da1eac557b4e2cc",
    "k": 26,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "You know they’ve said sea levels are going to rise by quite a few meters over the next 50 to 100 years.",
    "zh": "你知道，他们说未来50到100年，海平面将会上升好几米。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "sea level"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen028.png",
    "sha256": "6056db5e47eed26640c7fa516a200178e36acb1c75168d40b87adfd9ac4fabc9",
    "k": 27,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Weather conditions are getting worse all over the world.",
    "zh": "世界各地的天气状况都在恶化。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "condition"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen029.png",
    "sha256": "6f9d9980a7b52d7e65a06bcd4b2137fe8438960e6552a76906ff0c4bb11a679b",
    "k": 28,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Can you remember how many big hurricanes there have been in this country over the last few years?",
    "zh": "你还记得过去几年，我们国家遭遇了多少次强飓风吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "hurricane"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen030.png",
    "sha256": "01a79391c1495b1c55533bcaabd74b8e8d07a96a6373ff63c557cb7be87d9abd",
    "k": 29,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I think evidence is all around us.",
    "zh": "我觉得证据就在我们身边。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "evidence"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen031.png",
    "sha256": "b66f8b2951f15e2f2d319d302f85c232d9cc87034b3c4245aab414c6ec45f2a8",
    "k": 30,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I don’t think we have enough information, to be honest.",
    "zh": "说实话，我认为我们的信息还不够充分。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "information"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen032.png",
    "sha256": "e71cd69a193def6a5ab1d066d7801b4613e8204b0f651a9edc49e10c6567ecf5",
    "k": 31,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "We’ve only been measuring these things for around two or three hundred years.",
    "zh": "我们对这些现象进行测量，不过也就两三百年。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "measure"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen033.png",
    "sha256": "9bf778a0930df93d2ba8471859adf74d88aad4d23767913d31c930b36eb65288",
    "k": 32,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "We have no idea what was happening 50,000 years ago.",
    "zh": "五万年前发生过什么，我们根本不知道。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "have no idea"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen034.png",
    "sha256": "5f116bd2ea23a4e91d9eba1c937f16ceaaecbdfe0e00d0ca9f0b4ac5892546dc",
    "k": 33,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "For all we know, this is just a natural blip, a kind of sudden but temporary change, in the whole climate cycle.",
    "zh": "说不定，这只是整个气候周期中一次自然的小波动，也就是一种突然而短暂的变化。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "blip",
      "for all we know"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen035.png",
    "sha256": "4ed00bc9907375422955cf50b52da72dc53261d7d3508c2dc19dc7e0c12cccfa",
    "k": 34,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I don’t think we should change how we’re living just because of 20 years of abnormal measurements.",
    "zh": "我不认为，我们仅仅因为二十年的异常测量数据，就应该改变自己的生活方式。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "abnormal"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen036.png",
    "sha256": "9435e9bb6f201e527551b97bb9bd710c9c3404d6c9bdb491096d1a94de896869",
    "k": 35,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "And don’t you think all the other effects we’re having on the planet are destructive?",
    "zh": "那么，你不认为我们对地球造成的其他种种影响也具有破坏性吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "destructive"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen037.png",
    "sha256": "982c255511f7cc92c8d6e584277213b8ee24d11ce57af824fff36a84d46687f6",
    "k": 36,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "What do you mean?",
    "zh": "你指的是什么？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "mean"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen038.png",
    "sha256": "a6d0d382c2152e15dbdd35f3187115669067af7d8c51d15686062fb6fac1f8a9",
    "k": 37,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I mean like deforestation, overpopulation, threatening the existence of many endangered animals.",
    "zh": "比如森林砍伐、人口过剩，以及威胁许多濒危动物的生存。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "endangered"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen039.png",
    "sha256": "a7e2f296d0cf9a546d6d695b9303426b1cdba7247d9b67a3d00a9c28f8deeaca",
    "k": 38,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Pollution of the air and the seas.",
    "zh": "还有对空气和海洋的污染。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "pollution"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen040.png",
    "sha256": "dad32cee7b0e3617f40cd2ff4b7673e906c840e53c7b52c7dd6cac6a86b61ebc",
    "k": 39,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I mean, I could go on if you want.",
    "zh": "如果你愿意，我还可以继续列举。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "go on"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen041.png",
    "sha256": "06066500a5032de80bd744b6ae96d354681c055274b17c3dc0ecdd7ce92e1c90",
    "k": 40,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "No, no, I understand what you’re saying.",
    "zh": "不，不，我明白你的意思。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "understand"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen042.png",
    "sha256": "d673ed962206240dacadc2b98d9afcb6eedd55ac0c4e5837d3ec6a6862685711",
    "k": 41,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "And, yes, it’s true that there are several problems worldwide caused by human influence.",
    "zh": "而且，没错，世界各地的确有一些问题是人类活动造成的。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "worldwide"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen043.png",
    "sha256": "e6adce78b7c6b5258d3bdaef2932622b6883b5a9f23634e374bebfda509fda51",
    "k": 42,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I think the destruction of the Amazon rainforest is really dangerous and it’s something we could live to regret.",
    "zh": "我认为，亚马孙雨林遭到破坏确实很危险，将来我们可能会为此后悔。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "regret"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen044.png",
    "sha256": "370cdd6d3d16f8956bf738f0dc22fac1f1cc25e87d0981790655d071aa110017",
    "k": 43,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I read somewhere that they were considered to be the lungs of the planet.",
    "zh": "我曾在哪里读到过，它被称为地球之肺。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "lung"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen045.png",
    "sha256": "161350592bae3432b80592d8ecfb6d202038072c7907598e8cc05f01ed272eb1",
    "k": 44,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "And there we are happily chopping it all down and it would be a shame to lose some of those animals that may become extinct.",
    "zh": "可我们却还高高兴兴地把它砍掉；还有，失去一些可能灭绝的动物也很可惜。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "extinct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen046.png",
    "sha256": "403e90b03c66917f16b9b2fdd1518c86b88772b900654f301765c91456960067",
    "k": 45,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "You know, like the rhino or the panda.",
    "zh": "比如犀牛或熊猫。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "rhino"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen047.png",
    "sha256": "3a8871b6715cdff213ce530910c111ce8e4ff92773939145860593dd77fcd652",
    "k": 46,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "But I think we shouldn’t interfere with nature if they are going to become extinct.",
    "zh": "不过我认为，我们不该干涉自然；如果这些动物将要灭绝，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "interfere with"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen048.png",
    "sha256": "cab0e5fba4c74859fea6ca491f69685d456ae05c4fad950855432b050ae12c84",
    "k": 47,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Then we have to allow nature to take its course.",
    "zh": "那我们就得让自然顺其发展。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "take its course"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen049.png",
    "sha256": "f9e46bbc79e558a705e44cd66d384aa9c985c3ce058b2a6fc131affc543c1b14",
    "k": 48,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "You’ve just contradicted yourself in two sentences Kathy.",
    "zh": "凯西，你前后两句话就自相矛盾了。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "contradict"
    ]
